title: TalkToForge
---
<<if $firstForgeTalk is not true>>
<<set $firstForgeTalk = true>>
Ah, a new face at the forge. I can teach you to craft basic weapons if you bring the iron and wood.
-> Show me how to craft a sword.
    <<command: LearnRecipe "basic_sword">>
    Good. Bring the materials and I'll forge it for you. Use the workshop.
    -> Open the forge now.
        <<command: OpenCraft "forge">>
    -> Maybe later.
        Come back when you're ready.
<<else>>
Back for more? The forge is hot.
-> Craft a basic sword.
    <<command: OpenCraft "forge">>
-> Browse the forge wares (buy/sell).
    <<command: OpenShop "forge">>
-> Equip what I have.
    <<command: OpenEquip>>
-> Upgrade my gear instead.
    <<command: OpenUpgrade "armorer">>
-> Never mind.
    Safe travels.
<<endif>>
===
